#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiobuslayout.rst:14 5be032dfd1514ff5b76c8fd23c7d993f
msgid "Serializable configuration for FMOD audio buses and effect slots."
msgstr "FMOD 音频总线与效果器槽位的可序列化配置。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiobuslayout.rst:19 0178e9e320724388bc43be4a273223de
msgid "Description"
msgstr "描述"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiobuslayout.rst:21 38e6628a24334edea625e7c618f3ec52
msgid ""
"Stores bus configuration in display order. Bus and effect-slot IDs are stable identifiers, "
"separate from array indices. ``Master`` has ID ``0`` and remains first. Sends can target any bus "
"without creating a cycle; moving a bus changes only its display order."
msgstr "按显示顺序保存总线配置。总线和效果器槽位使用稳定 ID，与数组索引分别管理。``Master`` 的 ID 为 ``0``，始终位于首项。发送可指向任意无环目标；移动总线只改变显示顺序。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiobuslayout.rst:23 8d729bb85e734b00bd5ecb18aac6a78e
msgid ""
"Load and save layouts with :ref:`ResourceLoader<class_ResourceLoader>` and "
":ref:`ResourceSaver<class_ResourceSaver>`. The resource stores a format version and dynamic "
"properties such as ``bus/0/name`` and ``bus/0/effect/0/effect``. Channel groups, DSP instances, "
"metering data, and capture buffers belong to the runtime managed by "
":ref:`FmodServer<class_FmodServer>`."
msgstr ""
"通过 :ref:`ResourceLoader<class_ResourceLoader>` 和 :ref:`ResourceSaver<class_ResourceSaver>` "
"加载、保存布局。资源保存格式版本及 ``bus/0/name``、``bus/0/effect/0/effect`` 等动态属性。通道组、DSP 实例、电平数据及 Capture 缓冲由 "
":ref:`FmodServer<class_FmodServer>` 管理的运行时持有。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiobuslayout.rst:25 2459cac9769a4a689dae2fdb4e256821
msgid ""
"By default, ``audio/fmod/sync_godot_audio_buses`` is ``true``: Godot's "
":ref:`AudioServer<class_AudioServer>` supplies the bus configuration. To author an independent "
"layout, disable this setting and reload the project. ``audio/fmod/default_bus_layout`` defaults "
"to ``res://default_fmod_bus_layout.tres``. A missing or invalid default falls back to an in-"
"memory Master; load failures are reported."
msgstr ""
"``audio/fmod/sync_godot_audio_buses`` 默认为 ``true``，由 Godot 的 "
":ref:`AudioServer<class_AudioServer>` "
"提供总线配置。关闭此设置并重新加载项目后，可编辑独立布局。``audio/fmod/default_bus_layout`` 默认为 "
"``res://default_fmod_bus_layout.tres``。默认布局缺失或无效时，回退到内存中的 Master，并报告加载错误。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiobuslayout.rst:27 6cb7695c7d4a45f9bd217d9816b4d2b8
msgid ""
"The **FMOD Audio** editor Dock edits the active layout and saves configuration changes after a "
"``0.8``-second delay. Loading another layout does not change the project default; use **FMOD > "
"Set as Default** for that. The saved default reference uses a resource UID, and the export plugin"
" includes the default layout and its dependencies."
msgstr ""
"**FMOD Audio** 编辑器面板编辑当前布局，配置修改在 ``0.8`` 秒后合并保存。加载其他布局会保留项目默认值；通过 **FMOD > Set as Default** "
"将当前布局设为默认。保存的默认引用使用资源 UID，导出插件会包含默认布局及其依赖。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiobuslayout.rst:29 ddf30d5297c64ebf99492f5a8d31e0dc
msgid ""
"In independent mode, the Dock displays levels for audio played inside the editor. It uses the "
"native Audio panel's color settings, holds peaks for ``1.5`` seconds, and stops polling while "
"hidden. Levels from a separate running game process are not displayed. In synchronization mode, "
"the Dock shows a hint and an entry to open Godot's Audio panel; the FMOD bus controls and meters "
"are hidden."
msgstr ""
"独立模式下，面板显示编辑器内播放音频的电平，沿用原生 Audio 面板的颜色设置，保持峰值 ``1.5`` 秒，隐藏时停止轮询。独立游戏进程的电平暂未接入。同步模式下，面板显示提示和打开 "
"Godot Audio 面板的入口，并隐藏 FMOD 总线控件及电平表。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiobuslayout.rst:31 822aeff00955499a938052d5e11d19fb
msgid ""
"Edit the layout returned by "
":ref:`FmodServer.get_audio_bus_layout()<class_FmodServer_method_get_audio_bus_layout>` to update "
"its bound runtime on the next server update. Call "
":ref:`FmodServer.flush_bus_updates()<class_FmodServer_method_flush_bus_updates>` when immediate "
"access to a new bus or slot is needed. Each slot has its own runtime effect; obtain it with "
":ref:`FmodServer.get_bus_effect_instance()<class_FmodServer_method_get_bus_effect_instance>`. "
"Direct runtime edits do not modify the configuration resource."
msgstr ""
"修改 :ref:`FmodServer.get_audio_bus_layout()<class_FmodServer_method_get_audio_bus_layout>` "
"返回的布局，会在下一次服务器更新时应用到绑定的运行实例。需要立即访问新总线或槽位时，调用 "
":ref:`FmodServer.flush_bus_updates()<class_FmodServer_method_flush_bus_updates>`。每个槽位都有独立效果器实例，通过"
" :ref:`FmodServer.get_bus_effect_instance()<class_FmodServer_method_get_bus_effect_instance>` "
"获取。直接修改运行时对象不会改变配置资源。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiobuslayout.rst:35 cd4dde62cd5245cfbb19f1e1887d2f4d
msgid ""
"# Independent mode: Godot bus synchronization must be disabled\n"
"var layout: FmodAudioBusLayout = FmodServer.get_audio_bus_layout()\n"
"var music_id: int = layout.find_bus_id(&\"Music\")\n"
"if music_id == -1:\n"
"    music_id = layout.add_bus(&\"Music\")\n"
"layout.set_bus_volume_db(music_id, -6.0)\n"
"var slot_id: int = layout.add_bus_effect(music_id, FmodAudioEffectCapture.new())\n"
"FmodServer.flush_bus_updates()\n"
"var capture: FmodAudioEffectCapture = FmodServer.get_bus_effect_instance(music_id, slot_id) as "
"FmodAudioEffectCapture"
msgstr ""
"# Independent mode: Godot bus synchronization must be disabled\n"
"var layout: FmodAudioBusLayout = FmodServer.get_audio_bus_layout()\n"
"var music_id: int = layout.find_bus_id(&\"Music\")\n"
"if music_id == -1:\n"
"    music_id = layout.add_bus(&\"Music\")\n"
"layout.set_bus_volume_db(music_id, -6.0)\n"
"var slot_id: int = layout.add_bus_effect(music_id, FmodAudioEffectCapture.new())\n"
"FmodServer.flush_bus_updates()\n"
"var capture: FmodAudioEffectCapture = FmodServer.get_bus_effect_instance(music_id, slot_id) as "
"FmodAudioEffectCapture"

