#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiobuslayout.rst:188 196e71ba864644fa827a1e53b30cf34f
msgid ""
"Removes bus ``id`` and its effect slots. Buses sending to it are redirected to its previous send "
"target. Bound runtime channels are redirected on the next update. Master cannot be removed. "
"Returns :ref:`@GlobalScope.OK<class_@GlobalScope_constant_OK>` on success or "
":ref:`@GlobalScope.ERR_INVALID_PARAMETER<class_@GlobalScope_constant_ERR_INVALID_PARAMETER>`."
msgstr ""
"移除总线 ``id`` 及其效果器槽位。发送到该总线的其他总线会转接到其原发送目标，绑定的运行通道在下一次更新时转接。Master 不能删除。成功返回 "
":ref:`OK<class_@GlobalScope_constant_OK>`，无效参数返回 "
":ref:`ERR_INVALID_PARAMETER<class_@GlobalScope_constant_ERR_INVALID_PARAMETER>`。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiobuslayout.rst:198 64caa9d8d4144dbaa33e5588d95af943
