#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiobuslayout.rst:200 4cbafb968ca049299d57e2cad38ca4ef
msgid ""
"Moves bus ``id`` to the final display ``index``, from ``1`` to "
":ref:`get_bus_count()<class_FmodAudioBusLayout_method_get_bus_count>` minus one. Routing and IDs "
"are preserved. Master cannot be moved. Returns "
":ref:`@GlobalScope.OK<class_@GlobalScope_constant_OK>` on success or "
":ref:`@GlobalScope.ERR_INVALID_PARAMETER<class_@GlobalScope_constant_ERR_INVALID_PARAMETER>`."
msgstr ""
"将总线 ``id`` 移到最终显示位置 ``index``，范围为 ``1`` 到 "
":ref:`FmodAudioBusLayout.get_bus_count()<class_FmodAudioBusLayout_method_get_bus_count>` 减一。保留路由与"
" ID，Master 不能移动。成功返回 :ref:`OK<class_@GlobalScope_constant_OK>`，无效参数返回 "
":ref:`ERR_INVALID_PARAMETER<class_@GlobalScope_constant_ERR_INVALID_PARAMETER>`。"

