#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiobuslayout.rst:212 8e03de6c7a3747c4bbf40cd328b90e6f
msgid ""
"Renames bus ``id`` while preserving its ID, routing, and runtime instances. The name must be "
"unique, nonblank, and contain no comma. Master cannot be renamed. Player nodes store bus names; "
"update their ``bus`` properties when renaming a bus. Returns "
":ref:`@GlobalScope.OK<class_@GlobalScope_constant_OK>` on success or "
":ref:`@GlobalScope.ERR_INVALID_PARAMETER<class_@GlobalScope_constant_ERR_INVALID_PARAMETER>`."
msgstr ""
"重命名总线 ``id``，保留 ID、路由和运行实例。名称必须唯一、非空白且不含逗号，Master 不能重命名。播放器节点保存总线名称，重命名后需同步修改其 ``bus`` 属性。成功返回 "
":ref:`OK<class_@GlobalScope_constant_OK>`，无效参数返回 "
":ref:`ERR_INVALID_PARAMETER<class_@GlobalScope_constant_ERR_INVALID_PARAMETER>`。"

