#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiobuslayout.rst:332 6d65b60938b448dba9c3982362ce4d01
msgid ""
"Sets bypass for the managed effect slots on bus ``id``. Slot configuration and DSP state are "
"retained. This does not bypass the bus fader or unrelated DSPs added through low-level APIs."
