":ref:`FmodAudioEffect<class_FmodAudioEffect>`, index\\: :ref:`int<class_int>` = -1\\ )"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiobuslayout.rst:356 53ff7dac4ff1408db07c3e2de2a02f6a
msgid ""
"Inserts ``effect`` into bus ``bus_id`` before ``index``. A negative index appends it. Returns a "
"stable slot ID, or ``-1`` for an invalid bus, null effect, out-of-range index, or a bus with 512 "
"slots. Multiple slots may share a configuration resource; each bound slot receives its own "
"runtime instance. Read live Capture, SpectrumAnalyzer, or Record data through "
":ref:`FmodServer.get_bus_effect_instance()<class_FmodServer_method_get_bus_effect_instance>`."
msgstr ""
"将 ``effect`` 插入总线 ``bus_id`` 的 ``index`` 之前，负索引表示追加。返回稳定槽位 ID。总线无效、效果为空、索引越界或总线已有 512 个槽位时，返回 "
"``-1``。多个槽位可共享配置资源，各自拥有独立运行实例。通过 "
":ref:`FmodServer.get_bus_effect_instance()<class_FmodServer_method_get_bus_effect_instance>` 读取 "
"Capture、SpectrumAnalyzer 或 Record 的实时数据。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiobuslayout.rst:366 809c816d3e714ea8a74fdc53e6010a10
