msgid ""
"Moves slot ``slot_id`` from ``bus_id`` to ``target_bus``, inserting it before ``index`` in the "
"target list before removal. The index may equal the target slot count to append. The stable slot "
"ID and bound DSP state are preserved. Returns "
":ref:`@GlobalScope.OK<class_@GlobalScope_constant_OK>` on success or "
":ref:`@GlobalScope.ERR_INVALID_PARAMETER<class_@GlobalScope_constant_ERR_INVALID_PARAMETER>`."
msgstr ""
"将槽位 ``slot_id`` 从 ``bus_id`` 移至 ``target_bus``，插入删除前目标列表的 ``index`` 之前。索引等于目标槽位数时表示追加。保留稳定槽位 ID "
"和绑定的 DSP 状态。成功返回 :ref:`OK<class_@GlobalScope_constant_OK>`，无效参数返回 "
":ref:`ERR_INVALID_PARAMETER<class_@GlobalScope_constant_ERR_INVALID_PARAMETER>`。"

