#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiobuslayout.rst:440 e48d6126613547b0b1caca753b0fd4e8
msgid ""
"Atomically replaces the bus configuration with ``state``, using the format returned by "
":ref:`get_state()<class_FmodAudioBusLayout_method_get_state>`. Returns "
":ref:`@GlobalScope.OK<class_@GlobalScope_constant_OK>` on success or "
":ref:`@GlobalScope.ERR_INVALID_DATA<class_@GlobalScope_constant_ERR_INVALID_DATA>`, preserving "
"the previous configuration when validation fails. The layout accepts up to 4096 buses and 512 "
"slots per bus."
msgstr ""
"使用 :ref:`FmodAudioBusLayout.get_state()<class_FmodAudioBusLayout_method_get_state>` 的格式，以 "
"``state`` 原子替换总线配置。成功返回 :ref:`OK<class_@GlobalScope_constant_OK>`；验证失败时返回 "
":ref:`ERR_INVALID_DATA<class_@GlobalScope_constant_ERR_INVALID_DATA>`，并保留原配置。布局最多接受 4096 条总线，每条最多"
" 512 个槽位。"

