#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiobuslayout.rst:452 402785885dcf40fab4ad11c55c3aa169
msgid ""
"Returns an ordered array of bus dictionaries containing ``id``, ``name``, ``send_id``, "
"``volume_db``, ``solo``, ``mute``, ``bypass_fx``, and ``effects``. Each effect dictionary "
"contains ``id``, ``effect``, and ``enabled``. Effect resources are shared references. Use with "
":ref:`set_state()<class_FmodAudioBusLayout_method_set_state>` for structural undo and redo."
msgstr ""
"返回按顺序排列的总线字典数组，包含 ``id``、``name``、``send_id``、``volume_db``、``solo``、``mute``、``bypass_fx`` 和 "
"``effects``。每个效果器字典包含 ``id``、``effect`` 和 ``enabled``，效果资源保留共享引用。配合 "
":ref:`FmodAudioBusLayout.set_state()<class_FmodAudioBusLayout_method_set_state>` 用于结构修改的撤销重做。"

