msgid ""
"Returns :ref:`@GlobalScope.OK<class_@GlobalScope_constant_OK>` for a supported format version, a "
"valid Master, unique names and IDs, non-null effect resources, finite volumes, and acyclic "
"routes. Otherwise returns "
":ref:`@GlobalScope.ERR_INVALID_DATA<class_@GlobalScope_constant_ERR_INVALID_DATA>`."
msgstr ""
"格式版本受支持、Master 有效、名称与 ID 唯一、效果资源非空、音量为有限值且路由无环时，返回 :ref:`OK<class_@GlobalScope_constant_OK>`；否则返回"
" :ref:`ERR_INVALID_DATA<class_@GlobalScope_constant_ERR_INVALID_DATA>`。"
